---
const roles = ['Desarrollador de software', 'Creador de bots de Discord', 'Entusiasta del código abierto'];
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative flex min-h-[100svh] items-center overflow-hidden px-5 pt-28 pb-24 sm:px-6">
	<div
		class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/4 -left-32 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-[100px]"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
	</div>
	<div
		class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0 bottom-1/4 h-80 w-80 translate-x-1/3 rounded-full bg-accent-light/10 blur-[110px]"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
	</div>

	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:gap-10">
		<div class="text-center lg:text-left">
			<div data-reveal>
				<span
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 backdrop-blur"
				>
					<span class="relative flex h-2 w-2" aria-hidden="true">
						<span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-70"></span>
						<span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
					</span>
					Construyendo en código abierto
				</span>
			</div>

			<h1
				data-reveal
				style="--reveal-delay:80ms"
				class="text-balance mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
			>
				Hola, soy <span class="text-gradient">Tumonulo</span>
			</h1>

			<div
				data-reveal
				style="--reveal-delay:150ms"
				class="mt-5 flex min-h-8 items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm text-slate-400 sm:text-base lg:justify-start"
			>
				<span class="text-accent-soft">&gt;</span>
				<span id="hero-role" class="ml-2 transition duration-300" aria-live="off">{roles[0]}</span>
				<span class="animate-blink ml-1 inline-block h-4 w-[2px] bg-accent-light sm:h-5" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>

			<p
				data-reveal
				style="--reveal-delay:220ms"
				class="text-balance mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-400 sm:text-lg lg:mx-0"
			>
				Apasionado por la tecnología, el código limpio y el aprendizaje continuo. Me encanta explorar nuevas
				herramientas y construir soluciones útiles, desde bots para Discord hasta experiencias web modernas.
			</p>

			<div
				data-reveal
				style="--reveal-delay:300ms"
				class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 lg:justify-start"
			>
				<a href="#proyectos" class="btn btn-primary btn-shimmer group">
					Ver proyectos
					<svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-y-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M12 5v14M19 12l-7 7-7-7" />
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/tumonulo"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="btn btn-secondary btn-shimmer"
				>
					<svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
						<path
							d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.56 0-.28-.01-1.02-.02-2-3.2.7-3.88-1.54-3.88-1.54-.52-1.33-1.28-1.68-1.28-1.68-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.23-1.28-5.23-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.19-3.1-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.18 1.18a11.1 11.1 0 0 1 5.8 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.84 1.19 3.1 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.25 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14 0 1.55-.01 2.8-.01 3.18 0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.51 11.51 0 0 0 23.5 12C23.5 5.65 18.35.5 12 .5Z"
						/>
					</svg>
					Mi GitHub
				</a>
			</div>

			<div
				data-reveal
				style="--reveal-delay:380ms"
				class="mt-9 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 lg:justify-start"
			>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/tumonulo"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-slate-400 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-white"
					aria-label="GitHub personal"
				>
					<svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
						<path
							d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.11.79-.25.79-.56 0-.28-.01-1.02-.02-2-3.2.7-3.88-1.54-3.88-1.54-.52-1.33-1.28-1.68-1.28-1.68-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.23-1.28-5.23-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.19-3.1-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.18 1.18a11.1 11.1 0 0 1 5.8 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.84 1.19 3.1 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.25 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14 0 1.55-.01 2.8-.01 3.18 0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.51 11.51 0 0 0 23.5 12C23.5 5.65 18.35.5 12 .5Z"
						/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/ts-community"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-slate-400 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-white"
					aria-label="Organización TS Community en GitHub"
				>
					<svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M3 21v-6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h12a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6M8 3h8v9H8z" />
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://discord.gg/8nu3ZdDkp7"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-slate-400 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-white"
					aria-label="Servidor de Discord de TS Community Brawl"
				>
					<svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
						<path
							d="M20.3 4.4A19.8 19.8 0 0 0 15.4 3c-.2.4-.4.8-.6 1.2a18.3 18.3 0 0 0-5.5 0c-.2-.4-.4-.8-.6-1.2a19.7 19.7 0 0 0-4.9 1.5A20.3 20.3 0 0 0 .1 18a19.9 19.9 0 0 0 6 3c.5-.6.9-1.3 1.2-2a12.9 12.9 0 0 1-1.9-.9c.2-.1.3-.3.4-.4a14.3 14.3 0 0 0 12.2 0c.2.1.3.3.5.4-.6.3-1.2.6-1.9.9.4.7.7 1.4 1.2 2a19.8 19.8 0 0 0 6-3 20.3 20.3 0 0 0-3.4-13.6ZM8 15.3c-1.2 0-2.2-1.1-2.2-2.4 0-1.3 1-2.4 2.2-2.4 1.2 0 2.2 1.1 2.2 2.4 0 1.3-1 2.4-2.2 2.4Zm8 0c-1.2 0-2.2-1.1-2.2-2.4 0-1.3 1-2.4 2.2-2.4 1.2 0 2.2 1.1 2.2 2.4 0 1.3-1 2.4-2.2 2.4Z"
						/>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm lg:max-w-none" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:200ms">
			<div class="absolute -inset-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-accent/25 via-accent-light/15 to-transparent blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

			<div class="animate-float relative mx-auto h-64 w-64 sm:h-80 sm:w-80">
				<div class="avatar-ring animate-spin-slow absolute inset-0 rounded-full opacity-80 blur-[2px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
				<div class="absolute inset-[5px] rounded-full bg-ink" aria-hidden="true"></div>
				<img
					src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166932691?v=4"
					alt="Avatar de Tumonulo en GitHub"
					width="480"
					height="480"
					loading="eager"
					decoding="async"
					fetchpriority="high"
					class="absolute inset-[10px] h-[calc(100%-20px)] w-[calc(100%-20px)] rounded-full object-cover shadow-2xl shadow-black/50"
				/>

				<span class="animate-float absolute -top-2 -left-6 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-surface/90 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-accent-soft shadow-lg backdrop-blur" style="animation-delay: -3s">
					TypeScript
				</span>
				<span class="animate-float absolute top-1/4 -right-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-surface/90 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-emerald-300 shadow-lg backdrop-blur" style="animation-delay: -1.5s">
					Astro
				</span>
				<span class="animate-float absolute -bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-surface/90 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-indigo-300 shadow-lg backdrop-blur" style="animation-delay: -4.5s">
					Discord.js
				</span>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
				<span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 backdrop-blur">
					@tumonulo
				</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<a
		href="#sobre-mi"
		class="absolute bottom-7 left-1/2 hidden -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-2 text-slate-500 transition hover:text-accent-light md:flex"
		aria-label="Bajar a la sección sobre mí"
	>
		<span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase">Desliza</span>
		<span class="grid h-9 w-6 place-items-start rounded-full border border-white/15 p-1">
			<span class="h-2 w-1 animate-bounce rounded-full bg-accent-light"></span>
		</span>
	</a>
</section>

<script>
	const roleElement = document.getElementById('hero-role');
const roles = ['Desarrollador de software', 'Creador de bots de Discord', 'Entusiasta del código abierto'];
	const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

	if (roleElement && !reduceMotion) {
		let index = 0;
		let timer;

		const cycle = () => {
			roleElement.style.opacity = '0';
			roleElement.style.transform = 'translateY(-8px)';

			timer = window.setTimeout(() => {
				index = (index + 1) % roles.length;
				roleElement.textContent = roles[index];
				roleElement.style.transform = 'translateY(8px)';

				requestAnimationFrame(() => {
					roleElement.style.opacity = '1';
					roleElement.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
				});

				timer = window.setTimeout(cycle, 2400);
			}, 300);
		};

		roleElement.style.transition = 'opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease';
		timer = window.setTimeout(cycle, 2400);

		document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
			if (document.hidden) {
				window.clearTimeout(timer);
			} else {
				timer = window.setTimeout(cycle, 1200);
			}
		});
	}
</script>
